              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Hindi for the mother's mother, then the Hindi for the father's younger brother."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: मौसी",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मौसी (mausī) — \"aunt\", your mother's sister."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It is often explained as माँ जैसी, \"like a mother\": the aunt closest to a mother's place."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "An aunt, on your mother's side."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
